{"id":"autrefois","lemma":"autrefois","pos":"adv","rank":2233,"glosses":["previously; formerly (at a past time), erstwhile"],"ipa":"/o.tʁə.fwa/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/18/Fr-autrefois.ogg/Fr-autrefois.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"J'étais jeune et fou autrefois.","en":"I was young and crazy once.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"young"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"crazy, mad"},null]},{"text":"C'était autrefois presque impossible.","en":"It used to be nearly impossible.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"almost"},{"g":"impossible"}]},{"text":"Autrefois, nous jouions dans le parc.","en":"We used to play in the park.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/26311","words":[null,{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to play","l":"jouer"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"park"}]},{"text":"Autrefois il y avait ici une prison.","en":"There used to be a prison here.","words":[null,{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"prison"}]},{"text":"Autrefois la vie était différente.","en":"Life was different before.","words":[null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"life"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"different","l":"différent"}]}]}